OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed wife 78 times
OL,4,Ajailed for 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 66-year-old, of Ascot Drive,
OL,7,FTamworth, was told by a judge at
OL,8,FStafford Crown Court on Tuesday he
OL,9,Fwould serve a minimum of 18 years and
OL,10,F298 days in prison because of time
OL,11,Falready spent on remand.
